From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Carsen <carsenk@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 26/26] hip: raise Q4_K J96 MMQ occupancy to 3

The decode-only MoE prefill (6 of 128 experts) runs the Q4_K J=96 tile
selected by patch 0010. The RDNA4 config sets occupancy=2 for all Q4_K
tiles. Raising to 3 for J=96 lets the compiler target 3 resident blocks
per CU, which can hide memory latency better when the MoE tile's working
set is small. Arithmetic is unchanged; hash 29b53026dd77caf1.

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq-config-rdna4.cuh b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq-config-rdna4.cuh
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq-config-rdna4.cuh
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq-config-rdna4.cuh
@@ -122,7 +122,7 @@ static constexpr __host__ __device__ ggml_cuda_mmq_config ggml_cuda_mmq_get_conf
     CASE(GGML_TYPE_Q4_K, 128, 2,  64,  48, GGML_CUDA_MMQ_SRAM_LAYOUT_Q8_1, MMQ_ITER_K, false, false);
     CASE(GGML_TYPE_Q4_K, 128, 2,  64,  64, GGML_CUDA_MMQ_SRAM_LAYOUT_Q8_1, MMQ_ITER_K, false, false);
     CASE(GGML_TYPE_Q4_K, 256, 2, 128,  80, GGML_CUDA_MMQ_SRAM_LAYOUT_Q8_1, MMQ_ITER_K, false, false);
-    CASE(GGML_TYPE_Q4_K, 256, 2, 128,  96, GGML_CUDA_MMQ_SRAM_LAYOUT_Q8_1, MMQ_ITER_K, false, false);
+    CASE(GGML_TYPE_Q4_K, 256, 3, 128,  96, GGML_CUDA_MMQ_SRAM_LAYOUT_Q8_1, MMQ_ITER_K, false, false);
     CASE(GGML_TYPE_Q4_K, 256, 2, 128, 112, GGML_CUDA_MMQ_SRAM_LAYOUT_Q8_1, MMQ_ITER_K, false, false);
     CASE(GGML_TYPE_Q4_K, 256, 2, 128, 128, GGML_CUDA_MMQ_SRAM_LAYOUT_Q8_1, MMQ_ITER_K, false, false);
